### Battle Event Logging
- Always include acting entity (battalion/node) ID
- Include state transitions and their reasons
- Group under consistent prefixes:
  - [Battle] for general battle events
  - [Combat] for combat actions
  - [Target] for targeting events
- Avoid redundant logs of the same event

Example log formats:
- Targeting: "[Battle] {battalionId} targeting {targetType} {targetId}"
- State Change: "[Battle] {nodeId} state changed from {oldState} to {newState}"
- Combat: "[Battle] {attackerId} dealing {damage} damage to {targetId}"
- Retargeting: "[Battle] {battalionId} retargeting from {oldTarget} - {reason}"

